%% Kaur Khor record update benchmark architecture.
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Bench as Record update benchmark<br/>bench/scenarios/record-update.bench.ts
  participant Hub as Record Update hub
  participant Wizard as Lane wizard<br/>stock, supplier, sale, customer
  participant Workbench as Workbench tile dialogs
  participant Review as Review and save dialogs
  participant Provider as InventoryProvider
  participant Preload as Preload SENA bridge
  participant Main as Electron main IPC
  participant Core as Managed desktop-core pool
  participant Store as SQLite tickets<br/>anchors and summaries
  participant Metrics as Benchmark summary

  Bench->>Provider: wait for renderer.workspace.ready
  Bench->>Metrics: record benchmark.phase.measurement_start
  Bench->>Hub: open /record-update
  Hub->>Metrics: wait route.record-update.ready

  loop each hub lane
    Bench->>Hub: open lane card
    alt ticket-backed lane
      alt meaningful draft or editable ticket exists
        Hub->>Wizard: choose Resume, New, or Edit/Update
      else no meaningful draft or editable ticket
        Hub->>Wizard: open New ticket mode directly
      end
    else stock count lane
      Hub->>Wizard: open lane directly
    end
    Wizard->>Provider: get record update context and catalog state
    Provider->>Preload: sena.getRecordUpdateContext and supporting reads
    Preload->>Main: IPC read command
    Main->>Core: coalesced read-only command
    Core->>Store: read anchor hot rows, catalog, tickets, summaries
    Store-->>Wizard: lane context
    Wizard->>Metrics: record route.record-update.ready and lane nav duration
    Bench->>Hub: return to hub
  end

  Bench->>Wizard: open stock count lane
  Wizard->>Workbench: open first workbench tile
  Workbench->>Workbench: edit units in stock
  Workbench->>Review: open Review update dialog
  Review->>Preload: save stock count mutation
  Preload->>Main: IPC mutation
  Main->>Core: route mutation to writer
  Core->>Store: write ticket event and updated hot summaries
  Store-->>Review: save complete
  Review->>Metrics: wait route.dashboard.ready and record save_stock_count_ms

  Bench->>Wizard: open supplier order update
  Wizard->>Workbench: add receipt line
  Workbench->>Review: open Confirm receipt dialog
  Review->>Preload: save supplier receipt mutation
  Preload->>Main: IPC mutation
  Main->>Core: route mutation to writer
  Core->>Store: write supplier ticket receipt event and anchors
  Store-->>Review: save complete
  Review->>Metrics: wait route.dashboard.ready and record save_supplier_order_receipt_ms

  Bench->>Metrics: record benchmark.phase.measurement_end
  Bench->>Metrics: close app and persist record-update summary

  Note over Hub,Wizard: Customer and supplier order lanes skip the prompt when New is the only meaningful action.
  Note over Hub: Mode-only ticket placeholders are not treated as saved drafts.
  Note over Core,Store: Mutations write ticket events and bump read generation so subsequent reads refresh.
